# Groq-Only API + Location-Aware Problem/Solution Enhancement

## What this changes

The app currently supports OpenAI, Groq, and OpenRouter interchangeably. You want to:
1. **Groq-only** — strip out OpenAI/OpenRouter references everywhere; hardcode Groq's base URL and only offer Groq models
2. **Location-aware problems & solutions** — each idea card must prominently show the **local problem** and its **solution** tied to the specific location (lat/lon, city, country, nearby resources)
3. **All idea properties** — make sure every field (`id`, `title`, `category`, `difficulty`, `localProblem`, `whyHere`, `softwareSketch`, `hardwareSketch`, `bomPreview`, `suggestedResources`, `tags`) is displayed on every IdeaCard

